                <invention-title lang="de">LAUTSPRECHERANORDNUNG MIT EINSTELLBAREM AUFHÄNGUNGSSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">RÉSEAU DE HAUT-PARLEURS AVEC SYSTÈME DE SUSPENSION RÉGLABLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SPEAKER ARRAY WITH ADJUSTABLE HANGING SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Speaker mounting systems configured to assembly a line array coupled to a support are provided. The mounting systems generally include an engagement system having a hanger assembly with a boom arm including upper connection points. In a first speaker, the upper connection points can be operably coupled to the support. The line array can include a second speaker having an engagement system including a hanger assembly having a boom arm with upper connection points operably coupled to the lower connection points of the first speaker. The boom arm of the second speaker can be pivotably coupled to the second speaker such that the boom arm is adjustable between at least a first position, corresponding to a first splay angle between front faces of the first and second speakers, and a second position, corresponding to a second splay angle between the front faces of the first and second speakers.</p>
            </abstract>
